is_anomaly: true
faulty_devices: leaf_router_0_0
diagnosis_text:
Affected component: BGP advertising policy on leaf_router_0_0 (FRR configuration for IPv4 unicast).

Mechanism: The spines no longer have a route to 10.0.0.0/24, so any traffic from 10.0.1.0/24 toward 10.0.0.0/24 has no path beyond the spines. Each PC still pings its local gateway because the directly connected subnet and ARP on the leaf remain fine.

Localization: On leaf_router_0_0, interface eth2 is correctly configured with 10.0.0.1/24 (kernel route present), but BGP on the same device is not originating that prefix. Evidence:
- leaf_router_0_0 interface: eth2 inet 10.0.0.1/24 and kernel route 10.0.0.0/24 dev eth2.
- leaf_router_0_0 FRR config lacks an address-family stanza and network statement for 10.0
